    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109800/extras/047db8227083c2e0e99211d6142f839f.avif?t=1693594656\" /></div><br><br>WELCOME TO  FELLOWS FAMILY MANSION<br>                                                                                           <br>After 10 years, Alice receives a letter from her lost twin sister Astrid, and now she stands in front of Fellows Family Mansion. <br>She looks at the letter and the family photo under the heavy rain, her childhood memories are so dark. <br><br>Why she lost her twin sister? <br>What was the secrets of Fellows Family? <br>Why did they leave her to a foster family after Astrid\u2019s disappearance? <br><br>On a dark November night, Alice should solve Astrid\u2019s puzzles to find the answers of these questions.<br><br>My Dear Sister<br>It is a single player story horror game.<br>It is a game where players will progress by solving various puzzles and solve mysteries.",
